# The game's start (PowerOn, $80:8000) as a unit call: entered by a JSR from
# the stub at $00:8000, as the reset vector enters it, it clears the
# hardware and work RAM, resets S and starts the game anew under the
# scheduler (noreturn; the frames after it are compared in lockstep).
# From the first level's state the RAM's signature ($0000 = $0123) and the
# kept options' sum are as the game left them: the warm path ($80:80AF,
# KeptOptionsSum compared with $0006), which only a reset with the power
# kept on runs. Then again with the signature cleared: the cold path.
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 10
call 808000 noreturn frames=300
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 10
set 000000 00,00
call 808000 noreturn frames=300
